#: ../../source/docs/fbwb-mode.rst:5 89cb870defdf4a00b99ab1abf383279b
msgid "FBWB Mode (FLY BY WIRE B)"
msgstr "FBWB 模式（FLY BY WIRE B）"

#: ../../source/docs/fbwb-mode.rst:7 f98fe7b71357454fa99396001d0f3df5
msgid ""
"The FBWB mode is similar to :ref:`FLY BY WIRE A (FBWA) <fbwa-mode>`, but "
"Plane will try to hold altitude as well. Roll control is the same as FBWA, "
"and altitude is controlled using the elevator. The target airspeed is "
"controlled using the throttle."
msgstr ""
"FBWB 模式与 :ref:`FLY BY WIRE A（FBWA）<fbwa-mode>` 类似，但固定翼还会尝试保持高度。横滚控制与 FBWA "
"相同，高度通过升降舵控制。目标空速通过油门控制。"

#: ../../source/docs/fbwb-mode.rst:12 decb018b738f4720b8bf111a71677060
msgid ""
"To control your altitude in FBWB mode you use the elevator stick to ask for "
"a change in altitude. If you leave the elevator centered then Plane will try"
" to hold the current altitude. As you move the elevator stick, Plane will "
"try to gain or lose altitude at a rate in proportion to how far you move the"
" elevator. How much altitude it tries to gain for full elevator deflection "
"depends on the :ref:`FBWB_CLIMB_RATE<FBWB_CLIMB_RATE>` parameter, which "
"defaults to 2 meters/second. Note that 2 m/s is quite a slow change, so many"
" users will want to raise :ref:`FBWB_CLIMB_RATE<FBWB_CLIMB_RATE>` to a "
"higher value to make the altitude change more responsive."
msgstr ""
"在 FBWB "
"模式下，您使用升降舵摇杆来请求高度变化。若升降舵居中，固定翼将尝试保持当前高度。随着升降舵摇杆的移动，固定翼将按与摇杆偏移量成比例的速率升降。全升降舵偏转时尝试升降的高度取决于"
" :ref:`FBWB_CLIMB_RATE<FBWB_CLIMB_RATE>` 参数，默认为 2 米/秒。注意 2 m/s "
"变化相当缓慢，许多用户可能需要将 :ref:`FBWB_CLIMB_RATE<FBWB_CLIMB_RATE>` 调高以使高度变化更灵敏。"

#: ../../source/docs/fbwb-mode.rst:22 3eb7ce8c4c16486b9badd56ea4642b1e
msgid ""
"Whether you need to pull back on the elevator stick or push forward to climb"
" depends on the setting of the :ref:`FBWB_ELEV_REV<FBWB_ELEV_REV>` "
"parameter. The default is for pulling back on the elevator to cause the "
"plane to climb. This corresponds to the normal response direction for a RC "
"model. If you are more comfortable with the reverse you can set "
":ref:`FBWB_ELEV_REV<FBWB_ELEV_REV>` to 1 and the elevator will be reversed "
"in FBWB mode."
msgstr ""
"是否需要后拉或前推升降舵摇杆来爬升取决于 :ref:`FBWB_ELEV_REV<FBWB_ELEV_REV>` "
"参数的设置。默认情况下后拉升降舵会使飞机爬升，这与 RC 模型的正常响应方向一致。若您更习惯反向操作，可将 "
":ref:`FBWB_ELEV_REV<FBWB_ELEV_REV>` 设为 1，此时 FBWB 模式下升降舵将被反向。"

#: ../../source/docs/fbwb-mode.rst:29 4557bf41e78d4cda9a56e0ad6c6de2a4
msgid ""
"Note that the elevator stick does not directly control pitch, it controls "
"target climb or descent rate. The amount of pitch that will be used to "
"achieve this rate depends on your TECS tuning settings, but in general the "
"autopilot primarily climb or descend by raising or lowering the pitch AND "
"throttle. This can be disconcerting for people used to flying in FBWA mode, "
"where you have much more direct control over pitch."
msgstr ""
"请注意，升降舵摇杆并非直接控制俯仰，而是控制目标爬升或下降率。为达到该速率所需的俯仰量取决于您的 TECS "
"调参设置，但一般来说，飞控主要通过调整俯仰角和油门来爬升或下降。这对于习惯 FBWA 模式（对俯仰有更直接控制）的飞行员来说可能会感到不适应。"

#: ../../source/docs/fbwb-mode.rst:36 4fe246dcba9a4c5284503fe559b1a746
msgid ""
"If you have an airspeed sensor then the throttle will control the target "
"airspeed in the range :ref:`AIRSPEED_MIN<AIRSPEED_MIN>` to "
":ref:`AIRSPEED_MAX<AIRSPEED_MAX>`. If throttle is minimum then the plane "
"will try to fly at :ref:`AIRSPEED_MIN<AIRSPEED_MIN>`. If it is maximum it "
"will try to fly at :ref:`AIRSPEED_MAX<AIRSPEED_MAX>`."
msgstr ""
"若配备空速传感器，油门将在 :ref:`AIRSPEED_MIN<AIRSPEED_MIN>` 到 "
":ref:`AIRSPEED_MAX<AIRSPEED_MAX>` 范围内控制目标空速。油门最小时飞机将尝试以 "
":ref:`AIRSPEED_MIN<AIRSPEED_MIN>` 飞行，油门最大时将尝试以 "
":ref:`AIRSPEED_MAX<AIRSPEED_MAX>` 飞行。"

#: ../../source/docs/fbwb-mode.rst:41 2dda065c6dc747eabe0302cbf32dadd2
msgid ""
"If you don't have an airspeed sensor then the throttle input will set the "
"target throttle of the plane, which is :ref:`TRIM_THROTTLE<TRIM_THROTTLE>`, "
"at throttle midstick and lower positions, and Plane will adjust the throttle"
" around that value to achieve the desired altitude hold while trying to "
"maintain the pitch generally at its calibrated LEVEL setting, although the "
"autopilot will primarily use pitch for climbing and descending, and manage "
"throttle to maintain airspeed."
msgstr ""
"若没有空速传感器，油门输入将在中位及以下位置设定飞机的目标油门（即 "
":ref:`TRIM_THROTTLE<TRIM_THROTTLE>`），固定翼将围绕该值调整油门以保持目标高度，同时尽量将俯仰保持在校准的水平飞行设置，但飞控主要使用俯仰进行爬升和下降，并通过管理油门来维持空速。"

#: ../../source/docs/fbwb-mode.rst:45 308822883be44094a8d9dbdf75b6a597
msgid ""
"Increasing the throttle stick above mid-stick can be used to push the target"
" throttle up beyond what it calculates is needed, to fly faster."
msgstr "将油门摇杆推过中位以上可以将目标油门推高到系统计算所需值以上，以便飞得更快。"

#: ../../source/docs/fbwb-mode.rst:49 f15d389cf2ab486a8b934aca2315c0eb
msgid ""
"As with FBWA, the rudder is under a combination of manual control and auto "
"control for turn coordination."
msgstr "与 FBWA 一样，方向舵同时受手动控制和转弯协调自动控制。"

#: ../../source/docs/fbwb-mode.rst:52 6dfaf88c66d24e9eb14140d8720da886
msgid ""
"You should also have a look at CRUISE mode, as it is generally better than "
"FBWB, especially if there is significant wind. In CRUISE mode the aircraft "
"will hold a ground track as opposed to just leveling the wings when you "
"don't input any roll with the aileron stick."
msgstr ""
"建议您也了解 Cruise 模式，它通常优于 FBWB，尤其是在风力较大时。在 Cruise 模式下，飞机将保持地面航迹，而不是像 FBWB "
"那样在您不输入副翼横滚时仅保持机翼水平。"

